            <h2>Why Attend SABCS?</h2>

            <ul class="accordion" data-accordion data-allow-all-closed="true">
                <li class="accordion-item is-active" data-accordion-item>
                    <a href="#" class="accordion-title">The World's Largest Breast Cancer Symposium</a>
                    <div class="accordion-content" data-tab-content>
                        <p>Each December, more than 11,000 physicians, researchers, clinicians, and patient advocates from over 100 countries gather in San Antonio to present groundbreaking research, exchange ideas, and advance breast cancer care worldwide.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="accordion-item" data-accordion-item>
                    <a href="#" class="accordion-title">Advancing the Full Spectrum of Breast Cancer Research</a>
                    <div class="accordion-content" data-tab-content>
                        <p>Advancing the Full Spectrum of Breast Cancer Research, SABCS features the latest developments in experimental biology, etiology, translational science, prevention, diagnosis, treatment, and late-breaking clinical trials that shape clinical practice worldwide.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
                <li class="accordion-item" data-accordion-item>
                    <a href="#" class="accordion-title">Global Scientific Exchange</a>
                    <div class="accordion-content" data-tab-content>
                        <p>Global Scientific Exchange is at the heart of SABCS.</p>
                        <p>From groundbreaking discoveries to late-breaking clinical trials, SABCS brings together physicians, researchers, clinicians, and patient advocates from around the world to present new findings, exchange ideas, and build collaborations that accelerate progress in breast cancer research and patient care.</p>
                    </div>
                </li>
            </ul>


